# No browser

Do not open, navigate, lock, screenshot, or otherwise drive a browser for this project. That includes the Cursor IDE browser, browser MCP, Playwright, Puppeteer, and any localhost tab.

The user checks the running game themselves. Do not start a browser to "verify" UI, animations, or clicks.

When a change needs proof, use the code, existing tests, or a local script. Say plainly what was not seen in the app.
